# v0.3.0-alpha — Upstream v2.6.0 Sync

Syncs 6 upstream commits (PRs #1289–#1303) into our fork and bumps the internal version to `v0.3.0-alpha`.

## Proposed Changes

---

### GlobeMap Performance & Stability
Touches `src/components/GlobeMap.ts` — all three changes are additive.

#### [MODIFY] [GlobeMap.ts](file:///d:/Dev/GLOBAL-INTELLIGENCE-AI-DASHBOARD/src/components/GlobeMap.ts)

**#1299 — WebGL context loss guard**
- Add `private webglLost = false` field
- Add `webglcontextlost` / `webglcontextrestored` handlers on the canvas element
- Guard `flushMarkers()`, `flushMarkersImmediate()`, `flushArcs()`, `flushPaths()` with `|| this.webglLost` check

**#1303 — Idle rendering (stop 60fps RAF when idle)**
- Add `private idleTimer`, `private isGlobeAnimating`, `private visibilityHandler` fields
- Add `scheduleIdlePause()` method — pauses globe animation after 3s of idle
- Add `wakeGlobe()` method — resumes animation + resets idle timer
- Add `setupVisibilityHandler()` — pauses on tab hide, wakes on tab show
- Wire `wakeGlobe()` into canvas `mousedown`, `touchstart`, `wheel`, and throttled `mousemove` events
- Call `scheduleIdlePause()` and `setupVisibilityHandler()` at end of constructor
- Call `wakeGlobe()` at top of `flushMarkersImmediate()` and `flushArcs()`

